                <!-- §2 -->
                <h2 id="summary">2. Summary — Privacy at a Glance</h2>
                <div class="policy-highlight">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                    <div>
                        <strong>FlowSense is designed with privacy by default.</strong> Your financial data never leaves your device unless <em>you</em> explicitly choose to use a cloud AI provider with your own API key. We operate no servers that store your personal or financial information.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>100% local data storage</strong> — all transactions, budgets, and settings live in a private JSON file on your device.</li>
                    <li><strong>No user accounts</strong> — FlowSense requires no registration, email address, or password.</li>
                    <li><strong>No advertising or tracking</strong> — no analytics SDKs, no tracking pixels, no ad identifiers.</li>
                    <li><strong>Sensitive permissions are optional</strong> — each permission is used only for the stated feature; the app remains usable without them.</li>
                    <li><strong>API keys stay on your device</strong> — if you configure Cloud AI, your API key is stored locally and calls go directly from your device to the provider.</li>
                    <li><strong>In-app purchases</strong> are handled entirely by Google Play Billing — we never see or store payment information.</li>
                </ul>

