                <h2 id="permissions">7. Sensitive Permissions — Justification &amp; Handling</h2>
                <p>Google Play classifies certain permissions as sensitive. The table below documents each one, why FlowSense requests it, how the data is handled, and what happens if you deny it. All sensitive permissions are optional — denying them limits specific features but does not prevent core expense tracking.</p>

