                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Permission</th>
                                <th>Classification</th>
                                <th>Purpose in FlowSense</th>
                                <th>Data Handling</th>
                                <th>If Denied</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>READ_SMS</code> / <code>RECEIVE_SMS</code></td>
                                <td>Sensitive (SMS)</td>
                                <td>Read incoming and historical banking SMS messages to extract transaction amounts, merchants, and dates.</td>
                                <td>SMS content processed entirely on-device. Only the extracted transaction record is stored. Raw SMS text is never uploaded, logged, or retained.</td>
                                <td>SMS detection and inbox scan unavailable. Manual entry and other capture methods still work.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE</code> (Notification Listener)</td>
                                <td>Sensitive (Special Access)</td>
                                <td>Monitor notifications from user-selected banking apps to detect transaction events in real time.</td>
                                <td>Only notifications from apps explicitly in the user's monitored list are inspected. Notification text is processed locally to extract transaction data. Raw notification content is never stored or transmitted.</td>
                                <td>Notification-based transaction detection unavailable. All other features work normally.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION</code></td>
                                <td>Sensitive (Location)</td>
                                <td>Attach precise GPS coordinates to transactions for the Store Map feature.</td>
                                <td>GPS coordinates stored locally in the transaction record. Never transmitted to FlowSense or any third party (OSM map tile requests are IP-based, not coordinate-based).</td>
                                <td>Transactions are not geo-tagged. Store Map shows no location data.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION</code></td>
                                <td>Sensitive (Location)</td>
                                <td>Fallback location source for Store Map if fine location is unavailable.</td>
                                <td>Same as above.</td>
                                <td>Same as above.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>ACCESS_BACKGROUND_LOCATION</code></td>
                                <td>Sensitive (Background Location)</td>
                                <td>Allow geo-tagging of transactions detected via SMS or notifications when FlowSense is not in the foreground.</td>
                                <td>Location coordinates captured in the background are stored locally in the same transaction record. Never transmitted externally.</td>
                                <td>Transactions auto-detected in the background (SMS/notifications) will not include location data.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>CAMERA</code></td>
                                <td>Sensitive (Camera)</td>
                                <td>Capture receipt images for OCR scanning using Google ML Kit Text Recognition.</td>
                                <td>Camera frames processed in real time by ML Kit — an on-device library. No image is stored or uploaded. Only the extracted text (amount, merchant) is retained.</td>
                                <td>Receipt OCR scanning unavailable. Amounts must be entered manually.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>RECORD_AUDIO</code></td>
                                <td>Sensitive (Microphone)</td>
                                <td>Capture voice input for the Voice Transaction feature.</td>
                                <td>Audio is streamed directly to Android's SpeechRecognizer (on-device processing). FlowSense never receives, records, or stores raw audio. Only the resulting text transcription is used.</td>
                                <td>Voice transaction input unavailable.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES</code></td>
                                <td>Sensitive (App Visibility)</td>
                                <td>Enumerate installed apps for the Application Scanner feature, allowing users to discover and add banking apps to the monitored list.</td>
                                <td>App names and package identifiers are read only during the scan session and displayed in the UI. No app list is stored persistently or transmitted externally.</td>
                                <td>Application Scanner feature unavailable. Users can still manually enter package names to monitor specific apps.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>POST_NOTIFICATIONS</code></td>
                                <td>Normal</td>
